Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我……我在赔所有损失。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I'm... and I'm paying off all the damages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜·马丁的父亲进了重症监护室。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna Martin's father's in the I.C.U.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爸今早心脏出了问题。我得回家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your dad had a heart thing this morning. I have to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:30.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想再待几个小时，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just asking about a few more hours here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:32.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:34.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老公。你来这儿干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Husband. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.87,0:00:36.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想我了吗？当然想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you miss me? Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:38.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}辛西娅。嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cynthia. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.31,0:00:40.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真美。我怀孕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look incredible. I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:42.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打算不告诉我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Were you not going to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.68,0:00:44.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是你想的那样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:46.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我受够当侧室了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am done being the side-wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.21,0:00:48.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会再等你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I am not waiting for you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.55,0:00:49.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.72,0:00:51.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去他的，去你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Screw this and screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝瑟妮。你欠我三个月房租。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bethany. You owe me three months' back rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.65,0:00:55.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的东西在这儿。除了你的笔记本电脑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's your stuff. Except your laptop, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.69,0:00:58.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你24小时付钱，否则这台MacBook就挂到Craigslist上卖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have 24 hours to pay me or the MacBook goes on Craigslist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:01:00.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行。里面有会害到别人的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. There's things on there that could hurt people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.43,0:01:01.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这理由够充分，赶紧付钱吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great reason to pay me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.63,0:01:03.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我读了你那封没发出去的肉麻情书。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I read your unsent sappy love e-mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:06.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝瑟妮，别说了。杰瑞米现在跟莉齐订婚了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bethany, stop. Jeremy is engaged to Lizzie now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:07.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还找到了工作人员名单。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I also found the crew list.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:11.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚上10点前付钱，否则就发给名单上所有人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pay me by 10:00 P.M. or it goes live to all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:21.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天下午的活动，跟所有美好约会一样开场……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, this afternoon kicks off as all good dates do...
