Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酒会上会选出三位\N{\rEN\blur0.8}during which three of you will be chosen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.45,0:01:27.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}作为私密浪漫晚餐的客人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as guests for an intimate, romantic dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.39,0:01:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三人中会选出一位幸运女士\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And out of those three, one lucky lady will be selected
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.39,0:01:33.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与本人共度一整天的约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to enjoy a day-long date with yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:35.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会挑选赢家，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I won't be picking the winner
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:37.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事实上，所有选择我都不做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or making any of the choices, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.73,0:01:40.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把这些全交给我最好的哥们，罗杰·洛克伍德。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm leaving all of that to my best mate, Roger Lockwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.53,0:01:43.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}罗杰，进来跟大家打个招呼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Roger, come on in and say hello.
