Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.31,0:01:47.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看周围，就知道亚当真是个幸运的男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}From looking around, I can see that Adam is one lucky man.
