Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.58,0:01:53.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，停。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that's a cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:56.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，女士们，放松一下，喝点水……嘿，我们安排一下采访，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, ladies, you can relax, have some water... Hey, um, let's get interviews
