Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:34.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恐怕没怎么想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not a lot of thinking going on, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:35.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很明显。就是老毛病而已。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clearly. It's just sort of old habits.
