Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:48.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他坠入爱河之前，是不会让人碰他的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He doesn't get his knob polished until he's in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:50.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，瑞秋，你的工资。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Rachel, I've got your paycheck.
