Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.94,0:03:58.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想跟你说卡尔的事。咱们的摄影指导？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I was just about to tell you about Carl. Our D.P.?
